          "text": "A changing status."
        },
        {
          "start": 116,
          "duration": 3.5711666666666666,
          "file": "vo-0-3.wav",
          "text": "Keeping these details connected is a practical challenge in a computer laboratory."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "from": 240,
      "frames": 270,
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 13,
          "duration": 7.949041666666667,
          "file": "vo-1-0.wav",
          "text": "When records are separated, even a simple question takes longer to answer: which equipment is working, and which needs attention?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "from": 510,
      "frames": 240,
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 13,
          "duration": 6.943708333333333,
          "file": "vo-2-0.wav",
          "text": "Meet LabTracker, our native PHP and MySQL application for equipment records and maintenance tracking."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "from": 750,
      "frames": 360,
      "cues": [
        {
          "start": 13,
          "duration": 2.1546666666666665,
          "file": "vo-3-0.wav",
          "text": "We begin with administrator sign in."
        },
        {
          "start": 84,
          "duration": 6.826666666666667,
          "file": "vo-3-1.wav",
          "text": "The password stays hidden, and the application opens a shared workspace for managing laboratory assets."
